OL,3,AEx-president named leader of new DR
OL,4,ACongo rebel coalition
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Congolese President Joseph
OL,7,FKabila has been named the leader of a
OL,8,Fnew rebel coalition seeking to oust the
OL,9,Fgovernment.
OL,11,FThe Front for the Refoundation of the
OL,12,FNation (FRN) said it aimed to
OL,13,Fcoordinate "resistance forces" to end
OL,14,F"tyranny" in Democratic Republic of
OL,15,FCongo and would pursue the goal "by all
OL,16,Fmeans, including force".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
