OL,3,AEx-president named leader of new DR
OL,4,ACongo rebel coalition
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts unveiling on Monday is the clearest
OL,7,Findication so far of Kabila's direct
OL,8,Finvolvement in an armed movement a year
OL,9,Fafter he was sentenced to death in
OL,10,Fabsentia for treason. He had previously
OL,11,Fdenied having links to the M23 rebel
OL,12,Fgroup.
OL,14,FThe Congolese government has not
OL,15,Fcommented.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
